cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the version of EnerLint actually used. This alpha has no tagged release or DOI yet."
title: "EnerLint: Scope-limited physical consistency checks for energy-engineering outputs"
abstract: >-
  Experimental Python software for checking declared conservation and
  numerical consistency in energy engineering model exports. Its initial
  synthetic tests are not independent experimental validation.
